Cell["\<\
On a string algebra with the empty word, the empty word is among the words \
tested.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c01b5ccf-f523-416d-a106-63ae8a62a19b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 ", the test is finite: it says the relations hold in that range, not that \
they hold. For an A-infinity algebra whose operations vanish above some \
arity, a large enough ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " is conclusive."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6da93da3-d366-4796-9514-8cdbca57bb55"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "On a complex, a decomposition and a propagator the structure is finite and \
the relations multilinear, so the test is complete and takes no ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"072f6e37-52c4-4819-9c51-36c418741ec1"],

